---
/**
 * _kit — throwaway component-library preview, NOT the homepage.
 *
 * Underscore-prefixed pages are excluded from Astro's routing (dev and
 * build both skip them), so this never ships as a real route. To preview
 * it locally, temporarily rename this file to `kit.astro`, run
 * `npm run dev`, visit /kit, then rename it back before committing.
 */
import '@styles/tokens.css';
import InstrumentBar from '@components/twin/InstrumentBar.astro';
import TwinBubble from '@components/twin/TwinBubble.astro';
import VisitorBubble from '@components/twin/VisitorBubble.astro';
import StarterChip from '@components/twin/StarterChip.astro';
import Composer from '@components/twin/Composer.astro';
import Button from '@components/twin/Button.astro';
import Pill from '@components/twin/Pill.astro';
import CitedFact from '@components/twin/CitedFact.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>component kit — digital twin</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <button id="themeBtn" class="theme-btn" type="button">◐ toggle theme</button>

    <InstrumentBar current="/" />

    <main class="stage">
      <h1 class="section-title">Thread</h1>
      <div class="thread">
        <VisitorBubble label="interviewer">What did you actually do at Dentall?</VisitorBubble>
        <TwinBubble sources={['dentall-perf-10x', 'dentall-throughput']}>
          Hi — at Dentall I owned backend performance and the healthcare compliance layer. The
          headline: a core clinical query dropped from
          <CitedFact source="dentall-perf-10x">~5s to ~0.5s</CitedFact>, roughly a 10× cut. After
          the fix the service held <CitedFact source="dentall-throughput">40–60 RPS</CitedFact>
          steadily.
        </TwinBubble>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Starter chips</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <StarterChip selected>What did you do at Dentall?</StarterChip>
        <StarterChip>What's not on your résumé?</StarterChip>
        <StarterChip>Did you lead a 6-person team?</StarterChip>
        <StarterChip>用中文聊技術債</StarterChip>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Composer</h2>
      <Composer />

      <h2 class="section-title">Buttons</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <Button variant="primary">ask ↵</Button>
        <Button variant="secondary">Résumé</Button>
        <Button variant="ghost">skip</Button>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Provenance &amp; status pills</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <Pill variant="status" />
        <Pill variant="cited" />
        <Pill variant="draft" />
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Cited-fact highlight (whole word, not underline)</h2>
      <p class="prose-sample">
        Test coverage moved from <CitedFact source="dentall-coverage">~50% to ~80%</CitedFact> over
        the project, and the team held a steady <CitedFact source="dentall-throughput">40–60 RPS</CitedFact>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="section-title">Type roles</h2>
      <div class="typespec">
        <span class="lbl">twin / serif</span>
        <span class="demo-serif">The conversation is the portfolio.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="typespec">
        <span class="lbl">system / mono</span>
        <span class="demo-mono">cited · dentall-perf-10x · status:verified · 40–60 RPS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="typespec">
        <span class="lbl">visitor / sans</span>
        <span class="demo-sans">What's something your résumé doesn't show?</span>
      </div>
    </main>

    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--ground);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .theme-btn {
        position: fixed;
        top: 10px;
        right: 12px;
        z-index: 30;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--muted);
        cursor: pointer;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 6px 9px;
      }
      .stage {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-4) var(--space-8);
      }
      .section-title {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--twin-ink);
        margin: var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-3);
      }
      .thread {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: var(--space-5);
      }
      .row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: var(--space-2);
        align-items: center;
      }
      .prose-sample {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.62;
        max-width: 60ch;
      }
      .typespec {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-4);
        align-items: baseline;
        padding-bottom: var(--space-3);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
      }
      .typespec .lbl {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 11px;
        color: var(--faint);
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .demo-serif {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 22px;
      }
      .demo-mono {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .demo-sans {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 15px;
      }
    </style>

    <script>
      const btn = document.getElementById('themeBtn');
      const root = document.documentElement;
      btn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const cur =
          root.getAttribute('data-theme') ||
          (matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light');
        root.setAttribute('data-theme', cur === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark');
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
